@prefix autofde: <https://seanchatmangpt.github.io/autofde/ontology#> .
@prefix dcat: <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .


# Evidence, identity, replay, and standing
#################################################################

autofde:ExactSubject a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Subject .
autofde:ExactRevision a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:ExactSubject .
autofde:SourceCapsule a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Artifact .
autofde:ValidationPack a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Artifact .
autofde:ExecutionMode a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf skos:Concept .
autofde:ToolchainCapsule a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Artifact .
autofde:CommandExecution a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Evidence .
autofde:ReceiptDAG a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Receipt .
autofde:ReplayResult a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Evidence .
autofde:ArtifactDigest a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Evidence .
autofde:StandingCode a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf skos:Concept .
autofde:RefusalCode a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf skos:Concept .
autofde:IdentityBinding a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Evidence .
autofde:ConsequenceObservation a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Evidence .

#################################################################
